      "overall_design": "We studied four cases of surgically resected lung adenocarcinoma (LUAD).  Eight tissue FFPE sections (n = 2 each from the four LUAD samples) that included lepidic, filigree and mPAP elements were analyzed using Visium Spatial Gene Expression Profiling System. RNA transcriptome data were obtained from individual spots corresponding to each histological element. The mRNA levels in the lepidic, filigree, and mPAP components were then compared and analyzed."
